WEBVTT

00:06:59.660 --> 00:07:01.826
that we'd identified in the Fisher study.

00:07:02.686 --> 00:07:07.771
So Penijean, several times,

00:07:07.795 --> 00:07:09.669
hooked me up with all her electrodes,

00:07:10.573 --> 00:07:13.799
and she explained that I didn't
have to do or think anything.

00:07:13.823 --> 00:07:16.390
I just essentially
had to hold pretty still

00:07:16.414 --> 00:07:18.273
and stay awake

00:07:18.297 --> 00:07:19.575
and watch.

00:07:21.791 --> 00:07:25.614
(Harp and vibraphone sounds play)

00:07:25.638 --> 00:07:27.279
So I did.

00:07:27.303 --> 00:07:30.262
And every time my brain operated
in that healthy threshold,